Z||000004||ChadMan||02-28-2000||09:07 AM||||My second car was a Plymouth Champ (Mitsubishi)...it looked like a Pacer, but was fabricated from recycled soda cans.  I hit some ice turning into a parking lot, hit the curb at less than 5 mph, and bent the lower control arm.  Unbe-freakin-lievable.<P>Two weeks later, I bought my 84 Fiero, and you know the rest of the story.||||reg||1
